MakeCumulative:
// X2 contains the address of the D array
// X9 holds c, X10 holds -1, X13 will hold D[i]
ADDI X10, XZR, #-1 // setting X10 to -1 for comparision reasons
LDUR X9, [X2, #0] // saving D[0]
STUR XZR, [X2, #0] // setting D[0] to 0
ADDI X14, XZR, #0 // setting i = 0
ADDI X2, X2, #8 // incrementing array
LDUR X13, [X2, #0] // loading D[1]

loop:
ADDI X12, X9, #1 // X12 = c + 1
ADDI X9, XZR, X13 // redefining c
STUR X11, [X2, #0] // setting D[i+1] = D[i+1] + c + 1
ADDI X2, X2, #8 // incrementing array
LDUR X13, [X2, #0] // loading in next element for comparision
ADDI X14, X14, #1 // incrementing i
CMP X10, X13 // comparing next element with -1
B.NE loop // loop if not equal
ADDI X3, X14, XZR // setting X3 to i before returning
BR LR
